<title>UK: TABLE-Stakis H1 pretax profit rises 86 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Stakis H1 pretax profit rises 86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to March 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.84		   vs 2.23</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.05		   vs 0.95</p>
<p> Pretax		     22.17		  vs 11.95</p>
<p> Turnover		   141.08		 vs 95.79</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 21.0 and 25.2 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Stakis Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
